# The Great Goblin: "Whenever YOU put one or more counters on a Goblin, Orc, or Army you control". Bot2's Duskwatch Hunter puts its
# counter on the Great Goblin, a Goblin Bot1 controls: Bot2 put it, not Bot1, so nothing triggers and Bot2 takes no damage.

